 "remarks": "Welcome to River View Terrace, a beautifully maintained community ideally positioned on the Stamford/Darien border. This sophisticated ground-floor 2-bedroom residence has been thoughtfully updated, blending modern luxury with effortless everyday living. The open-concept interior is highlighted by gleaming hardwood floors, stylish lighting and a stunning chef's kitchen featuring quartz countertops, abundant cabinetry, a deep farmhouse sink and stainless-steel appliances, including a new refrigerator. Entertain with ease as the spacious living area flows to a recently redone private deck-perfect for cocktails, alfresco dining or quiet mornings. When temperatures drop, gather around the wood-burning fireplace for cozy evenings at home. Both bedrooms are generously proportioned with excellent closet space, complemented by additional custom-organized hallway storage and in-unit laundry with a new washer. A private one-car garage, oversized storage, additional assigned parking (#3) and a serene seasonal pool complete the package. Walk to Metro-North and enjoy easy access to beaches, Downtown Stamford, dining, shopping and I-95. Stylish, turnkey and exceptionally convenient-this is condo living elevated. Click on movie icon for virtual tour.",
